# Blade and frontend

- Layout `layouts/app.blade.php`. Reuse `x-*` and `partials/topbar`. Traffic views live under **`trafic/`** (misspelling).
- All user-visible strings through `lang/{ru,uz,en}`. Add three locales together.
- View composers already pass `abonentType` and `isPermanent`. Header FIO is session `full_name`, not profile `name`.
- CSRF meta is required; period filters POST via `resources/js/modules/ajax.js`.
- JS: small module in `resources/js/modules/`, boot from `app.js`. Delegation; no-op if markup missing. No React/Livewire.
- Tailwind 4 via Vite on the **host**. `public/build` is gitignored.
- Hide promo/loyalty/chat/top-up until config URL/flag is set. Legal entities: hide tariff nav (controller 403 is the real gate).
